  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jamalam.tech/mod-assets/jamlib-banner.png\" alt=\"JamLib：用於 JamCore 所有模組的跨平台函式庫\"></p>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/JamCoreModding/jamlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報問題</a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.jamalam.tech%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Discord 聊天</a> • <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jamlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjamlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>JamLib 提供：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>平台抽象層</li>\n<li>JSON5 設定檔 API</li>\n<li>模組轉貼（如 9minecraft 等）檢查器</li>\n</ul>\n<p>詳細說明文件可於此處 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.jamalam.tech%252fjamlib%252fgetting-started%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fjamalam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e0cc6668-0d29-40ff-9820-4d4f5433198a.webp\" alt=\"使用 Bisect Hosting 租用伺服器：輸入代碼 jamalam 可享 25% 折扣\"></a></p>",
